cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below and cite the associated scientific publication."
title: "Radial bright-band detection"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hosseini
    given-names: Hasan
    affiliation: "Swedish Meteorological and Hydrological Institute (SMHI), Sweden"
    email: hasan.hosseini@smhi.se
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6130-0937"
version: 1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/hasan-hosseini/radial-bright-band"
abstract: >-
  Python implementation of radial bright-band detection and
  significant rise-fall segmentation using azimuthal reflectivity
  profiles derived from ODIM HDF5 weather radar volumes.
  The repository includes scripts and example radar data for
  reproducing Figures 4 and 5 of the associated scientific manuscript.
keywords:
  - weather radar
  - bright band
  - melting layer
  - radar reflectivity
  - C-band radar
  - ODIM HDF5
